{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-1","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ef0a31908b232616bff09378","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-1","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.269","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-djyvbk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Give assurance a declared noun placement and history-author-acknowledge a history leaf: the two live commands whose consolidation owners closed without moving them"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"## Scope\nTwo live top-level commands lost their consolidation owner when the owning items closed without moving them.\n\n1. assurance is an SDK-owned governance surface (measurements, assertions, gates) with no noun in the twelve-noun grammar. Decide its placement with a recorded pbyu ruling: an ops assurance leaf (diagnostics family, where the census currently points), or a keep-as-is exception because it is a first-class data noun like plan. Whichever is chosen, the destination row flips from consolidation to target_noun or keep_as_is.\n2. history-author-acknowledge is the only history-* spelling still registered at the root. Give it a canonical leaf under the history noun (history acknowledge, matching the shared verb vocabulary) with the root spelling kept as a hidden permanent alias, and carry the relocation through contracts, completions, MCP action parity and docs.\n\n## Constraints\nZero feature loss; the help-token budget for the affected commands has zero headroom, so the new leaf's help must not exceed the text it replaces. Positional shape count stays within its budget."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","assurance","cli","consolidation","grammar","history"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A pbyu ruling records where assurance lives in the noun grammar and the destination row flips from consolidation to target_noun or keep_as_is; pm history acknowledge (or the shared-verb spelling the ruling picks) is the canonical leaf; history-author-acknowledge remains executable as a hidden permanent alias with identical arguments, results and exit codes; Contracts, shell completions, MCP action parity and docs reflect the relocation and the command-grammar gate passes with no positional-shape or help-token budget growth"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"assurance has a recorded noun disposition and history-author-acknowledge resolves to a canonical history leaf with its root spelling as a hidden permanent alias."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-3ig9b6","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-j82fd3","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-tqel","kind":"supersedes","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:57:54.945Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","aut